<title>NETHERLANDS: Stork details 1996 stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Stork details 1996 stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial systems and services group Stork NV said on Thursday it had set its 1996 optional stock dividend at one new share per 38 held.</p>
<p>On March 4, the company announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 1.90 guilders, up from 1.50 in 1995, or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Stork's shares were trading at 75.60 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Thursday, down 1.60 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
